 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(N \cdot M)$ per pixel, where $N$ is the number of objects in the buffer and $M$ is the number of ray-marching steps. This is significantly slower than static SDF rendering where $N$ is effectively constant or hardcoded [S1, unofficial].
